# Server-authoritative starter skill catalog.
# Element= puts a magic in one of the five elements (Metal, Wood, Water,
# Fire, Earth): only refinery or artifact resistance to it lessens it.
# Values are intentionally small and easy to tune while the combat vertical
# slice is being built. Ranges follow the level-0 distance of the original
# ini/MagicType.dat and the attack magics repeat every 800 ms, as in the
# reference servers. One [Skill] section describes one skill.

